# Project Rules - 0G Hackathon Cannes

## Workflow
1. ALWAYS plan before coding. Update plan.md with checklist.
2. One feature at a time. Complete -> Test -> Next.
3. Commit after each working feature.
4. Test as you go - don't build a mountain then test.

## Code Style
- TypeScript strict mode
- Functional components (React)
- Tailwind CSS for styling
- File names: kebab-case
- Components: PascalCase
- API routes: /api/v1/resource

## Don'ts
- Never use `any` type
- No console.log in production code
- Don't install new dependencies without asking
- Don't over-engineer - MVP first, scale later

## Security (check every feature)
- Input validation on user-facing endpoints
- No secrets in code (use .env)
- Rate limiting on public APIs
- Sanitize outputs (XSS prevention)

## 0G Network
- Testnet RPC: https://evmrpc-testnet.0g.ai (Chain ID: 16602)
- Mainnet RPC: https://evmrpc.0g.ai (Chain ID: 16661)
- Storage SDK: @0gfoundation/0g-ts-sdk
- Docs: https://docs.0g.ai
- AI Context: https://docs.0g.ai/ai-context

## When Stuck
- Ask AI to debug its own output with the error message
- Explain root cause before fixing
- If prompted 5+ times for same thing, do it manually
